  "project_description": "DROWL Media Types is the configuration-heavy submodule of the DROWL Media project. It installs a full set of ready-made media types (slide, slideshow, vector_image) and re-configures the core types (image, document, video, remote_video, audio) with DROWL's fields, view modes, image styles, responsive image styles, Slick optionsets, crop types and Bootstrap-based display templates. It also adds a settings form for slide/slideshow default values. It pulls in a large stack of contrib dependencies (blazy, crop, focal_point, slick, svg_image, photoswipe, fences, field_group, micon and more).",
